  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support the Government of Georgia improve its PFM framework at the central level and local level in order to contribute to fiscal sustainability and service delivery. The activities that will be carried out under the following components: Budget Planning, execution and reporting1.Strengthening Medium-term Budgeting2.Fiscal Risk Reporting3. Performance Information4. Revenue Administration5. Public Investment Management6. Public Internal Financial</narrative>
  </description>
